e plan.":"If you purchased a layaway plan, please keep in mind the installments will be individually refunded back to the method of payment used during each step of the plan.","Processing individual payments could result in installments processing on different dates and times. Please allow 10 business days for this process to complete. This includes the use of multiple methods of payment. The card that was on file for each transactions will be individually refunded.":"Processing individual payments could result in installments processing on different dates and times. Please allow 10 business days for this process to complete. This includes the use of multiple methods of payment. The card that was on file for each transactions will be individually refunded.","Questions? Email us at:":"Questions? Email us at:","View your layaway terms and conditions %openTags%HERE.%closeTags%":"View your layaway terms and conditions %openTags%HERE.%closeTags%","Your %labelTitle% Refund - Order #%xOrderId%":"Your %labelTitle% Refund - Order #%xOrderId%","Total:":"Total:","Address cannot exceed {{maxAddressLength}} characters":"Address cannot exceed {{maxAddressLength}} characters","Ticket:":"Ticket:","Item ID:":"Item ID:","Status:":"Status:","account.reset_password_link":"A link to reset your password has been sent. If you do not receive it shortly, please check your junk or spam email folder.  If you do not have an account, please select <a id=\\"manage_order_forgot_password\\" style=\\"cursor: pointer;\\">Manage Order</a>.","Add tickets to your digital wallet.":"Add tickets to your digital wallet.","of":"of","Visit the Front Gate Tickets":"Visit the Front Gate Tickets","Support Site":"Support Site","for more information":"for more information","Seat":"Seat","Your phone is your ticket":"Your phone is your ticket","View Mobile Tickets":"View Mobile Tickets","View More":"View More","Save your tickets to your phone below or present the attached digital ticket at the entrance of the event