":"Estimated payments include any applicable tax and processing fees.","popover.all_inclusive_handling_fee":"This fee is charged once per order and is often shared between venues or promoters and Front Gate Tickets.","popover.promo_code_default":"Not working? This field is for promo codes. Passcodes are entered on the ticket selection page.","We can text that to you":"We can text that to you","sms.orderUpdates":"Send me order updates!","(Optional)":"(Optional)","sms.terms":"Standard text messaging rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt-out of receiving future text messages. For more information, please see our <a href=\\"%terms_link%\\" class=\\"terms_policy_link underline font-bold\\" target=\\"_blank\\">%terms_label%</a> and <a href=\\"%privacy_link%\\" class=\\"terms_policy_link underline font-bold\\" target=\\"_blank\\">%privacy_label%</a>.","sms.digital-delivery-opt-in-text":"Yes, I\'d like to receive my <strong>digital tickets</strong> via text message in addition to email.","sms.digital-delivery-opt-in-estimated-time-text":"Your ticket(s) will be sent closer to your event date","sms.order-tracking-opt-in-text":"Yes, I\'d like to receive <strong>order tracking updates</strong> via text message in addition to email.","sms.order-tracking-opt-in-text-estimated-time-text":"Order tracking updates will be sent when your order ships, typically 3-4 weeks prior to your event date","Order Update: Your next %labelTitle% layaway payment is upcoming":"Order Update: Your next %labelTitle% layaway payment is upcoming","Notice: Your %labelTitle% layaway plan has been cancelled due to nonpayment":"Notice: Your %labelTitle% layaway plan has been cancelled due to nonpayment","Order Update: Your %labelTitle% layaway plan has been cancelled":"Order Update: Your %labelTitle% layaway plan has been cancelled","Hi":"Hi","The cancellation of your layaway plan on <strong>Order %xOrderId%</strong> is complete":"The cancellation of your layaway plan on <strong>Order %xOrderId%</strong> is complete","You were refunded a total of:":"You were refunded a total of:","We have retained %retainValue% in applicable fees":"We have retained %retainValue% in applicable fees","Please allow <span style=\\"font-weight: 700;\\">7-10 business days</span> to see the refund on your account":"Please allow <span style=\\"font-weight: 700;\\">7-10 business days</span> to see the refund on your account","Please note that <span style=\\"font-weight: 700;\\">each installment is refunded individually</span> therefore you may see multiple refund transactions in the amount above. Each transaction will be refunded to the method of payment used for that transaction":"Please note that <span style=\\"font-weight: 700;\\">each installment is refunded individually</span> therefore you may see multiple refund transactions in the amount above. Each transaction will be refunded to the method of payment used for that transaction","This email is to notify you that <strong>Order %xOrderId% </strong> has been <strong>cancelled due to non-payment</strong>":"This email is to notify you that <strong>Order %xOrderId% </strong> has been <strong>cancelled due to non-payment</strong>","Please allow <span style=\\"font-weight: 700;\\">7-10 business days</span> for the funds to show on the original method of payment, minus the <strong>%termFee% cancellation fee</strong> which has been retained. Please note, as your order was purchased via layaway, <strong>your refund will be processed in multiple transactions.</strong>":"Please allow <span style=\\"font-weight: 700;\\">7-10 business days</span> for the funds to show on the original method of payment, minus the <strong>%termFee% cancellation fee</strong> which has been retained. Please note, as your order was purchased via layaway, <strong>your refund will be processed in multiple transactions.</strong>","Per the layaway plan agreement, your order is subject to cancellation at any point after a payment has failed at the event promoter`s discretion. Thes